         <title>
            SmartIndicator Version 1.5.0
         </title>
         <description>
            <p>
               This update installs the script SmartIndicator Version 1.5.0
               for PixInsight.
            </p>
            <p>
               Under Script → Render you will find SmartIndicator. It enables you to generate and blend an indicator (scale, orientation, or angular separation) onto a target image. 
            </p>
            <p>
               Last update: added new angular separation indicator type, updated doc
            </p>
